  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2302601",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ziryab",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260101": {
            "id": "230260101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "I wonder if these questions are too difficult...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260102"
            ]
          },
          "230260102": {
            "id": "230260102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Hey! Traveler! Hold on a second.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260103"
            ]
          },
          "230260103": {
            "id": "230260103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Who, me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260104"
            ]
          },
          "230260104": {
            "id": "230260104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Yep! Hehe, I would like to ask you a small favor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260108"
            ]
          },
          "230260108": {
            "id": "230260108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "What? ...Why did you sound so familiar with this? Ahaha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260109"
            ]
          },
          "230260109": {
            "id": "230260109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "But no, no. I didn't lose anything, nor did I lack research materials. As for inspiration... Well, I've found enough of it on my own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260110"
            ]
          },
          "230260110": {
            "id": "230260110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Ahem, actually, I'm compiling a \"Q&A\" brochure to help the freshmen quickly grasp the various terms circulating in Sumeru.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260111"
            ]
          },
          "230260111": {
            "id": "230260111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "In a nutshell, it's to explain complicated nouns in the form of questions and answers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260112"
            ]
          },
          "230260112": {
            "id": "230260112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "This way, it'll be more efficient and interesting for students to learn.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260113"
            ]
          },
          "230260113": {
            "id": "230260113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "However, I'm not sure about the difficulty of these questions... so I thought I could use your help with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302602",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ziryab",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260801": {
            "id": "230260801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Okay. That's all for my questions today. Let's see how many questions you answered correctly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260802"
            ]
          },
          "230260802": {
            "id": "230260802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Well done! You've got all three questions right. Looks like you've done your homework in Sumeru!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260803"
            ]
          },
          "230260803": {
            "id": "230260803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Please take these as a reward for all the work you've done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302603",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ziryab",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260901": {
            "id": "230260901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Hmm... you didn't answer them all correctly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260902"
            ]
          },
          "230260902": {
            "id": "230260902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Hehe, it's alright. It's quite normal for a new visitor in Sumeru to answer some of the questions wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260903"
            ]
          },
          "230260903": {
            "id": "230260903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Please take these as a thank-you for answering my questions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302605",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260501": {
            "id": "230260501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Have you been outside the Sumeru City? There are some barriers around the desert.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260502"
            ]
          },
          "230260502": {
            "id": "230260502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "My question is: what's the name of those barriers?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260504",
              "230260506",
              "230260508"
            ]
          },
          "230260504": {
            "id": "230260504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Actually, it's \"Wall of Samiel.\" Don't forget that."
          },
          "230260506": {
            "id": "230260506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Actually, it's \"Wall of Samiel.\" It's used to proof sand, not wind. Hope you can recall it next time."
          },
          "230260508": {
            "id": "230260508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Good, good. You got it right!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302606",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260601": {
            "id": "230260601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Sumeru merchants often use a kind of beast to carry their goods when traveling long distances.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260602"
            ]
          },
          "230260602": {
            "id": "230260602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "My question is: what's the name of the beast?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260604",
              "230260606",
              "230260608"
            ]
          },
          "230260604": {
            "id": "230260604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Sumpter Beast it is. What a memory!"
          },
          "230260606": {
            "id": "230260606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Actually, it's \"Sumpter Beast.\" Hope you can recall it next time."
          },
          "230260608": {
            "id": "230260608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Actually, the name of the beast is \"Sumpter Beast.\" Hope you can recall it next time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302607",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260701": {
            "id": "230260701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "There is... well... to put it simply, a mushroom-like monster in the wilderness of Sumeru.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260702"
            ]
          },
          "230260702": {
            "id": "230260702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "My question is: what's the name of the monster?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260704",
              "230260706",
              "230260708"
            ]
          },
          "230260704": {
            "id": "230260704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Fungi it is. They resemble mushrooms, after all."
          },
          "230260706": {
            "id": "230260706",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Actually, it's \"Fungi.\" Think of mushrooms when you're recalling the word."
          },
          "230260708": {
            "id": "230260708",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "That's not even close... The answer should be \"Fungi.\" Think of mushrooms when you're recalling the word."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302612",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ziryab",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302602",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260201": {
            "id": "230260201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Ahem... As you may know, each Darshan in the Akademiya has its own specialized focus on research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260202"
            ]
          },
          "230260202": {
            "id": "230260202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "So, what's the name of the Darshan with the largest number of researchers? I'll give you a hint — it's the school with Biology as its major focus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260204",
              "230260206",
              "230260208"
            ]
          },
          "230260204": {
            "id": "230260204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Exactly!"
          },
          "230260206": {
            "id": "230260206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Well, quite the opposite of the correct answer."
          },
          "230260208": {
            "id": "230260208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Haha, unfortunately, that's not the answer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302603",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260301": {
            "id": "230260301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Maybe you have come across some traveling researchers who call themselves Driyosh Traveling Scholars.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260302"
            ]
          },
          "230260302": {
            "id": "230260302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Actually, there are a great number of Driyosh in one of the Darshans of the Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260303"
            ]
          },
          "230260303": {
            "id": "230260303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "With the elements as the core of its theory, this Darshan studies a full range of things closely tied with elemental powers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260304"
            ]
          },
          "230260304": {
            "id": "230260304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "My question is: what's the name of this Darshan?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260306",
              "230260308",
              "230260310"
            ]
          },
          "230260306": {
            "id": "230260306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "That's right. Spantamad, home to Elementalism researchers who see the Seven Great Elements as the essence of all matter and life."
          },
          "230260308": {
            "id": "230260308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Haha, wrong answer. Haravatat researchers study language, semiotics and logic... Trust me, it's really complicated."
          },
          "230260310": {
            "id": "230260310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Well, unfortunately, You got it wrong. Rtawahist is the base camp of Illuminationism researchers whose research focus lies in the universe above us... Hehe, doesn't that sound appealing?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302604",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230260401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230260401": {
            "id": "230260401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "If you look up, can you see the tree holding up the Akademiya?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260402"
            ]
          },
          "230260402": {
            "id": "230260402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "My next question is a simple one that many would easily ignore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260403"
            ]
          },
          "230260403": {
            "id": "230260403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Now listen, what's the name of the tree holding up the Akademiya?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230260405",
              "230260407",
              "230260409"
            ]
          },
          "230260405": {
            "id": "230260405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Haha, pretty concise. But unfortunately, it's wrong."
          },
          "230260407": {
            "id": "230260407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Haha, good, good! It's correct!"
          },
          "230260409": {
            "id": "230260409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ziryab",
            "text": "Well, as powerful as it sounds, it's wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}